## Rubric
- [x] Confirm PutObjectAcl is treated as an evaluable object action in bucket policy (bucket_policy.rs:593-604).
- [x] Confirm bucket policy condition evaluator supports s3:x-amz-acl and s3:x-amz-grant-* keys (bucket_policy.rs:1088-1128).
- [x] Trace PutObjectAcl authorization path and verify ACL/grant headers are not added to PolicyRequest (authz.rs:483-526, 796-806).
- [x] Verify PolicyRequest has ACL/grant fields but StringEquals conditions fail when actual is None (bucket_policy.rs:191-239, 1133-1157).
